## Important Things to Know

- DNS filtering is not a full security system.
- Your VPN or device settings may override router DNS.
- Some routers may not support secure DNS (DoH/DoT) settings.
- Your ISP may still provide DNS in some cases depending on your setup.
- DNS helps with name resolution, but it is not the same as antivirus or firewall protection.

